   :summary "Inspect, set or reset the global AI provider/model without editing configuration or restarting. Changes require a trusted admin and retain normal tool policy; explicit request flags win. Runtime choices reset on restart. Zen defaults remain freshly verified-free, while an explicit admin choice may select a paid model on another configured provider."
