  {:id "free-zen-defaults"
   :date "2026-11-01"
   :component "app"
   :title "Zen defaults follow currently free offerings"
   :summary "When no model is configured, Zen defaults verify current zero input, output and advertised cache pricing before selection. Expired offers are not retained; unknown or paid pricing fails closed. Trusted admins can set a free Zen preference through the global runtime AI default controls. Explicit --model remains an intentional choice, including paid models. Catalog eligibility does not prove access: rate or quota limits can still reject inference."
   :commands ["zen Say hello" "ai --provider zen Say hello"]
